SUMMARY:Wildlife Trivia! (Fairview)
DESCRIPTION:Come join ReWild AVL\, local chapter of the North Carolina Wildlife Federation alongside Blue Ridge Audubon for an afternoon of wildlife trivia at Turgua Brewing. We will be asking wildlife\, habitat\, and birding related questions to test your knowledge of all things WILD in North Carolina. This event is free and open to everyone. The trivia will range from easy to moderately challenging! No registration required. See you there!
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/wildlife-trivia-fairview/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
